// Innerscape desktop half. Plain ESM for the Hermes desktop plugin SDK: no build
// step, imports only from the SDK and React. Data comes from the agent half's
// dashboard/plugin_api.py through ctx.rest, which calls your own Innerscape
// server. Fonts (Chakra Petch, OFL) and the cairn mark are embedded by
// tools/embed-assets.py between the ASSETS markers below. Do not hand-edit that block.
